PATCH /v1/notification-settings/owners/{ownerId}
Update notification settings for the owner with the provided ID.
Required: ownerId (path) — The ID of the workspace to return resources for; body (body)

PATCH /v1/notification-settings/overrides/services/{serviceId}
Update the notification override for the service with the provided ID.
Required: serviceId (path) — The ID of the service; body (body)

GET /v1/notification-settings/owners/{ownerId}
Retrieve notification settings for the owner with the provided ID. Note that you provide an owner ID to this endpoint, not the ID for a particular resource.
Required: ownerId (path) — The ID of the workspace to return resources for

GET /v1/notification-settings/overrides/services/{serviceId}
Retrieve the notification override for the service with the provided ID. Note that you provide a service ID to this endpoint, not the ID for a particular override.
Required: serviceId (path) — The ID of the service
